Blink: the media type a page's CSS is for, for the embedder.

Playwright's emulateMedia({ media: 'print' }) is DevTools'
Emulation.setEmulatedMedia, which sets the page's media type override in
Blink's settings; nothing outside Blink can. zebkit's automation sets it
through blink::SetMediaTypeOverride (web/web_media_emulation.h, one new
file).

